{% comment %}
  SECTION: Homepage Hero (Replacement)
  Replaces the current "Eliminate Fatigue. Activate Clean All-Day Energy" hero.

  HOW TO ADD:
  Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Sections → New section (name: pc-hero)
  Paste this file. Then in the theme editor, add "PC Hero" to the homepage above the fold.
  Remove the old hero section from the template.

  IMPORTANT BEFORE PUBLISHING:
  - Product URL corrected 2026-08-27: the real handle is
    /products/the-power-coffee-10-days-pack (confirmed via Admin API product
    list) — /products/power-coffee 404s, it was never a real handle.
  - Replace the background image URL in .pc-hero style block below
  - Kill the "A.I. science formula" line on the existing product page before launching this
{% endcomment %}

<section class="pc-hero">
  <div class="pc-hero__inner">

    <div class="pc-hero__eyebrow">
      11 real ingredients. Real doses. Nothing hidden.
    </div>

    <h1 class="pc-hero__headline">
      Your 10am crash<br>isn't caffeine wearing off.
    </h1>

    <p class="pc-hero__sub">
      Caffeine's still in your system. What crashes is your blood sugar.
      Power Coffee adds cinnamon, pea protein, and 9 more functional ingredients
      to hold the floor. One scoop in the coffee you already make.
    </p>

    <div class="pc-hero__cta-block">
      <a href="/products/the-power-coffee-10-days-pack" class="pc-hero__cta">
        Start for $1.26 a morning
      </a>
      <span class="pc-hero__cta-sub">$18.90 · 15 servings · free shipping</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-hero__trust">
      <span class="pc-hero__trust-item">
        <span class="pc-hero__stars">★★★★★</span> 4.9 from 112 verified buyers
      </span>
      <span class="pc-hero__trust-sep">·</span>
      <span class="pc-hero__trust-item">Made in USA</span>
      <span class="pc-hero__trust-sep">·</span>
      <span class="pc-hero__trust-item">30-day guarantee</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.pc-hero {
  background: #171412;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  padding: 100px 24px 80px;
  font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.pc-hero__inner {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.pc-hero__eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(217,166,51,0.3);
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.pc-hero__headline {
  font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 68px);
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1.08;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
}

.pc-hero__sub {
  font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px);
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.7);
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 0 auto 40px;
}

.pc-hero__cta-block {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.pc-hero__cta {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #D9A633;
  color: #171412;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 800;
  padding: 18px 44px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  text-decoration: none;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  transition: opacity 0.18s;
}

.pc-hero__cta:hover {
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.pc-hero__cta-sub {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.45);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.pc-hero__trust {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px 16px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.5);
}

.pc-hero__stars {
  color: #D9A633;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin-right: 4px;
}

.pc-hero__trust-sep {
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.2);
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .pc-hero {
    padding: 72px 20px 60px;
  }
  .pc-hero__cta {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 18px 24px;
  }
  .pc-hero__trust-sep {
    display: none;
  }
  .pc-hero__trust {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "PC Hero",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
